---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
const updated = '2026-09-28';
---
<ContentLayout title="Terms of Use" h1="Terms of Use" path="/terms" updated={updated} description="The terms that govern use of BamaMotors.com by car shoppers and dealerships, including listings, reviews, fees and disclaimers.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>By using BamaMotors.com you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>
    <h2>1. What BamaMotors is</h2>
    <p>BamaMotors is an online marketplace that lets Alabama dealerships list vehicles and lets shoppers find and contact them. <strong>We are not a party to any vehicle sale</strong>, we are not a dealer, and we are not a lender. Transactions are solely between you and the dealership.</p>
    <h2>2. Accounts</h2>
    <p>You must provide accurate information and keep your password secure. You're responsible for activity under your account. We may suspend accounts that violate these Terms.</p>
    <h2>3. Dealer obligations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Dealers must be properly licensed to sell vehicles and must be authorized to list each vehicle.</li>
      <li>Listings must be accurate — including price, mileage, title status and known damage — and kept up to date. Sold vehicles must be marked sold.</li>
      <li>Dealers must own or have permission to use every photo and description they upload. Content copied from other websites without permission is prohibited.</li>
      <li>Dealers must comply with applicable laws, including the FTC Used Car Rule and advertising and consumer-protection laws.</li>
      <li>Leads may be used only to respond to the shopper's request.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>4. Shopper responsibilities</h2>
    <p>Listing information is provided by dealers. Verify all details, inspect the vehicle, and review all documents before purchase. Estimated payments shown on the site are examples, not offers of credit.</p>
    <h2>5. Reviews</h2>
    <p>Reviews must reflect your genuine experience with the dealership. We moderate reviews and may remove content that is false, abusive, promotional or off-topic. Dealers may not post, buy or incentivize reviews.</p>
    <h2>6. Fees</h2>
    <p>Using BamaMotors is free for shoppers. Dealers may purchase subscription plans or featured listings as described on the <a href="/for-dealers">For Dealers</a> page. Subscriptions renew monthly until canceled.</p>
    <h2>7. Prohibited conduct</h2>
    <p>Don't scrape the site, interfere with its operation, post unlawful or misleading content, impersonate others, or use the site to send spam.</p>
    <h2>8. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p>The site is provided “as is.” We don't guarantee the accuracy of listings, the condition of any vehicle or the conduct of any dealer or user.</p>
    <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, BamaMotors is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of the site or any transaction with a dealer.</p>
    <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Alabama, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>
    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms and will change the date above when we do. Continued use means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="/contact">Contact us</a> with any questions about these Terms.</p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
